  "prompt": "单个独立的深色橡木圆形盆栽，圆柱盆身，上沿略厚，底部轻微收窄，盆体仅使用深棕色系 #52362E、#714D48、#8E664D，带细致的深色橡木纹理；土壤必须为很深的棕色 #52362E。生成3个明确不同的形态：形态0为空盆，只有土壤，绝对没有植物；形态1种植一株低矮茂密的深色圆叶植物，叶片仅使用 #5F6F48 和 #76904C；形态2种植一株向外垂落但不接触地面的深色藤叶植物，叶片仅使用 #5F6F48 和 #809712。每个资产中必须恰好只有一个盆，不能出现第二个盆、托盘、支架、标签或场景底座。禁止浅色、白色、亮绿色、鲜艳颜色和发光材质。\nCoordinate contract: local Y+ is up, local Z+ is the front, entrance, or forward direction, and local X+ is right. Put doors, facades, openings, windshields, noses, seats, and other recognizable front details toward local Z+. For a modular repeated element, explicitly choose the long axis: side-by-side modules span local X with depth/front on local Z; traversal modules span local Z. Keep the model centered at its origin.\nCanonical dimensions contract: width=1.4, height=1.75, depth=1.4 world units. Keep the generated mesh within this centered bounding size.\nCreate variation 2 of 3; preserve the same reusable asset family while varying silhouette and details.",
